Student-Hub implements a specialized backend system for student profile and portfolio management with several interconnected business components:

### Core Business Components

1. Profile Management System
- Handles student profile updates and portfolio modifications
- Implements institutional validation rules
- Manages file attachments and metadata
- File: `src/components/ProfileManagement.js`

2. Portfolio Processing Pipeline
- Transforms raw portfolio submissions into standardized formats
- Applies institutional content policies
- Manages version control of portfolio items
- File: `src/transformers/PortfolioTransformer.js`

### Validation & Policy Layer

1. Custom Validators
- Enforces institution-specific profile requirements
- Validates portfolio content and file types
- Files: 
  - `src/validators/ProfileValidator.js`
  - `src/validators/PortfolioValidator.js`

2. Policy Management
- Enforces institutional content guidelines
- Manages privacy settings and access controls
- File: `src/policies/PolicyEnforcer.js`

### Workflow Orchestration

1. Profile Update Workflow
- Coordinates profile modification processes
- Manages approval workflows
- Handles notification systems
- File: `src/workflows/WorkflowManager.js`

### Component Importance Scores

1. Profile Management System: 95
- Critical core business functionality
- Direct impact on user experience
